## 5. QUALITY SCORING (105 Points)

| Category | Points | Key Criteria |
|----------|--------|--------------|
| RAML Syntax | 15 | Valid header, HTTPS, imports resolve |
| Structure | 20 | Fragments organized, security via !include |
| Documentation | 20 | API + resources + methods documented |
| Security | 15 | Layer-appropriate, all endpoints secured |
| RESTful Design | 15 | Correct methods, status codes, nouns |
| API-Led Compliance | 10 | Correct layer pattern, base URI |
| Enterprise | 5 | Health endpoint, correlation ID, RFC 7807 |
| Organization | 5 | Directory structure, metadata file |

### Thresholds
| Score | Status | Action |
|-------|--------|--------|
| 95-105 | 🏆 Perfect | Deploy immediately |
| 85-94 | 🌟 Excellent | Production ready |
| 75-84 | ✅ Good | Review recommendations |
| <75 | ⚠️ Needs Work | Apply improvements |

**Minimum for production: 85 points**

