## 8. HEADER TEMPLATES

### RAML Header
```yaml
#%RAML 1.0
title: {API Name} {Layer} API
description: |
  {Purpose description}
  API-Led Layer: {Experience|Process|System}
version: v1
baseUri: https://api.company.com/{layer}/v1
mediaType: application/json
protocols: [HTTPS]

uses:
  CommonTypes: fragments/libraries/common-types.raml

securitySchemes:
  api_key: !include fragments/security-schemes/api-key-auth.raml

securedBy: [api_key]
```

### OpenAPI Header
```yaml
openapi: 3.0.3
info:
  title: {API Name} {Layer} API
  description: |
    {Purpose description}
    API-Led Layer: {Experience|Process|System}
  version: v1

servers:
  - url: https://api.company.com/{layer}/v1

security:
  - ApiKeyAuth: []

components:
  securitySchemes:
    ApiKeyAuth:
      $ref: './components/security/api-key.yaml'
```

