## 9. HTTP METHODS & STATUS CODES

| Method | Use | Idempotent | Success Code |
|--------|-----|------------|--------------|
| GET | Retrieve | Yes | 200 |
| POST | Create | No | 201 |
| PUT | Replace | Yes | 200 |
| PATCH | Update | Yes | 200 |
| DELETE | Remove | Yes | 204 |

### Required Error Codes
- **400** - Validation errors
- **401** - Unauthorized
- **403** - Forbidden
- **404** - Not found
- **500** - Server error

