## 10. ENTERPRISE PATTERNS

### Health Endpoint (MANDATORY)
```yaml
/health:
  get:
    securedBy: []  # Public
    responses:
      200:
        body:
          application/json:
            example: !include examples/responses/health.json
```

### Correlation ID (MANDATORY)
```yaml
headers:
  X-Correlation-Id?:
    type: string
    description: Request tracing ID
```

